  "<p>Path to the output file</p>": "<p>输出文件的路径。</p>",
  "<p>Pretty-print with 2-space indentation (slightly slower)</p>": "<p>使用 2 个空格缩进格式化输出（稍慢）。</p>",
  "<p>Export items as JSON Lines (one JSON object per line).</p>": "<p>将数据项导出为 JSON Lines，每行一个 JSON 对象。</p>",
  "<p>Export items to a CSV file.</p>": "<p>将数据项导出到 CSV 文件。</p>",
  "<p>Items that don't share the same keys are still written, with the missing cells left empty, and any value\nthat isn't a scalar (a nested dictionary or a list) is written as JSON.</p>": "<p>键不完全相同的数据项仍会写入文件，缺失的单元格会留空，非标量值（嵌套字典或列表）会以 JSON 写入。</p>",
  "<p>The columns to write, defaulting to every key found in the items, in the order they appeared</p>": "<p>要写入的列，默认包括数据项中的所有键，按首次出现的顺序排列。</p>",
  "<p>The character separating the columns</p>": "<p>列分隔符。</p>",
  "<p>Export items to an XML file.</p>": "<p>将数据项导出到 XML 文件。</p>",
  "<p>Each item becomes an element whose children are named after the item's keys. Keys that aren't valid XML\nnames are rewritten and keep the original in a <code>name</code> attribute, and any value that isn't a scalar\n(a nested dictionary or a list) is written as JSON.</p>": "<p>每个数据项会变成一个元素，其子元素以数据项的键命名。不符合 XML 名称规则的键会被改写，原始名称保存在 <code>name</code> 属性中。非标量值（嵌套字典或列表）会以 JSON 写入。</p>",
  "<p>The name of the element wrapping all the items</p>": "<p>包含所有数据项的元素名称。</p>",
  "<p>The name of the element wrapping every item</p>": "<p>包含单个数据项的元素名称。</p>",
  "<p>Pretty-print the file instead of writing it on a single line</p>": "<p>格式化文件，便于阅读，而不是将内容全部写在一行。</p>",
