  "<p>Register a session instance.</p>": "<p>注册会话实例。</p>",
  "<p>Name to reference this session in requests</p>": "<p>在请求中引用此会话的名称。</p>",
  "<p>Your pre-configured session instance</p>": "<p>预先配置好的会话实例。</p>",
  "<p>If True, this becomes the default session</p>": "<p>为 True 时，将此会话设为默认会话。</p>",
  "<p>If True, the session will be started only when a request uses its ID.</p>": "<p>为 True 时，仅在请求使用此会话 ID 时启动会话。</p>",
